<description>&lt;p&gt;Manipur remains volatile as the state high court has kept the census on hold until April 2027 while the government reports over 4,000 firearms recovered and the transfer of the Kuki youths murder case to the NIA, with the chief minister meeting the victims' families and the home minister pledging safe return of displaced persons. In Kashmir, a six-year-old boy was killed by a leopard in Baramulla and a 27-year-old man died when an unidentified vehicle struck his scooter in Srinagar. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Frontline Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Free Press Journal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxNamVTYnFkNWdVZ19mWkl5aTl5UTNzaktjVXlBUjB5Mk5OeVdraVFoMi1OZUNRTzVmUGx0eHFfcmo5cXZVd3J3UVUyWW9HeGFTOHUwVGhRY2VOajZGWl9ZR3hYWEgxUTJVN2o5UW84YXZESXJ0T2xrZFo2MWZKaWF2NzFKeTlDV0ljbVpFN1Vad0ktZ2hY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Life&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNdHowTWVOSEV1eUFHTjhrY2hDTDAxcTMxa3dBRGdaYXRucXFOaE4wUVNRUUF5U1k4NzJYampjRkh3WGdSS2lhU1JUMTdWWjRWU0dWbjFyNm1zbmJVRzhHeEpocl9mUEt0TXlVejRpNDkyV2E5Nk1zLUhzXzljSnF6VDRYNW1VQU1PT1F0ZWFtd242UVdFVzR0SDI4Vlk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQZnRUTVhJS0JsZ240WHRJaWNKWHBucDZxMnJoejBCRE56RlI3ekJQT1BWR0M5bHZ6U1hha1RKX3d3YkJic2FtS3d3cHNQa04tRmwtc2NIYlFFNjF1blMtSmhpdnRyVldEbHlFRWFmZjdJMnE5aWM0dF9iX01zTnhtdWlONE9YSC12cFBjc1FoM0dYOWFhQ0psOGRMWlNadF9GY1Aweg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Life&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;OpIndia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;Big News Network.c